  "headline": "MPR Verifies 24 November Qualifications For Amran And Sugiono",
  "seoTitle": "24 november MPR Verifies Amran And Sugiono Qualifications",
  "metaDescription": "The MPR will verify the qualifications of vice presidential candidates Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono on 24 November following nominations by Prabowo Subianto.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The MPR has scheduled factual verification of qualifications for vice presidential nominees Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono for 25-26 November.",
    "President Prabowo Subianto officially proposed both candidates to the MPR, stating that neither individual is permitted to withdraw from the nomination.",
    "Golkar chairman Bahlil Lahadalia and other political figures have acknowledged the suitability of both candidates, pending further formal political decisions."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On 24 November 2026, the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) announced it would begin a formal verification process for vice presidential candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono. These individuals were proposed by President Prabowo Subianto, and officials confirmed that the nominees are not permitted to withdraw from the selection process. The verification procedure includes examining secondary education credentials, with the MPR summoning relevant school officials to Jakarta. The upcoming factual verification process is scheduled to take place between 25 and 26 November. Political reactions to the nominations have been varied, with figures from parties including Golkar, the Democratic Party, and the DPD RI noting the candidates' backgrounds in government and professional experience. Meanwhile, other factions like PKB have indicated they will conduct internal discussions with coalition partners to determine their stance on the presidential proposal.",
